# ── earshot: Audible data & auth ──────────────────────────────────────────────
# Raw Audible pull (root only) — has order/account fields. The curated,
# copyright-safe subset lives in public/data/ and IS committed.
/data/
# Local Audible auth — NEVER commit. Token lives in the AUDIBLE_CONFIG secret.
.audible/
*.audible.json
